WEBVTT

01:21.400 --> 01:26.850
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.530 --> 01:29.600
[Episode 26]

01:29.980 --> 01:31.530
[The Penal Court]

01:32.070 --> 01:32.590
My Lord.

01:33.310 --> 01:35.530
Miss Gu has been looking
for you these past few days.

01:35.530 --> 01:36.840
She asked if you would be free tomorrow

01:36.840 --> 01:38.300
and would like to meet you.

01:39.759 --> 01:41.350
What is so urgent?

01:41.590 --> 01:42.350
Well,

01:43.509 --> 01:45.310
I do not know.

01:51.200 --> 01:52.530
Then remind me tomorrow

01:52.680 --> 01:54.430
to bring the new set of hair ornaments.

01:54.430 --> 01:55.310
That color

01:55.590 --> 01:56.590
looks good on her.

01:59.920 --> 02:00.430
My Lord.

02:01.040 --> 02:01.970
Miss Xue is here.

02:02.200 --> 02:04.000
She is waiting in your duty room.

02:04.840 --> 02:05.840
Did you let her in?

02:06.040 --> 02:06.840
Yes.

02:07.430 --> 02:09.690
She said she had an appointment with you.

02:10.360 --> 02:11.710
Go get ten strokes.

02:15.960 --> 02:17.030
Since you like

02:17.030 --> 02:18.190
the Penal Court so much,

02:18.190 --> 02:19.450
why not just stay here?

02:19.710 --> 02:20.430
I have plenty of

02:20.430 --> 02:21.560
empty rooms here.

02:22.150 --> 02:23.800
The conditions are quite good.

02:23.800 --> 02:25.280
For your father's sake,

02:25.520 --> 02:27.520
I can arrange a private room for you.

02:30.910 --> 02:32.630
You only talk to me like that

02:32.750 --> 02:33.520
because you know

02:33.520 --> 02:34.710
that I like you.

02:35.000 --> 02:36.870
If I ever stop liking you,

02:37.190 --> 02:39.000
try talking to me like that again.

02:39.000 --> 02:40.120
Xue Qinglan.

02:40.190 --> 02:40.920
Don't panic.

02:44.400 --> 02:46.000
Although I am pursuing you,

02:46.120 --> 02:47.500
I still know my limits.

02:48.430 --> 02:49.520
This is the Penal Court,

02:49.520 --> 02:50.430
not your residence.

02:50.430 --> 02:51.890
I won't do anything to you.

02:54.560 --> 02:55.490
Why are you here?

03:01.750 --> 03:03.350
I came to tell you something.

03:04.430 --> 03:05.120
What is it?

03:05.630 --> 03:06.590
Say it quickly

03:06.960 --> 03:07.960
and then get lost.

03:13.240 --> 03:14.280
Chen Yanyun

03:14.960 --> 03:16.620
has proposed to the Gu family.

03:18.310 --> 03:19.240
What did you say?

03:25.190 --> 03:26.190
To whom?

03:27.140 --> 03:28.120
Who else?

03:28.680 --> 03:29.870
Gu Jinzhao, of course.

03:29.870 --> 03:30.750
You're talking nonsense.

03:30.750 --> 03:32.079
Why would I make this up?

03:32.750 --> 03:34.170
All the ladies and misses
of every household

03:34.170 --> 03:35.570
already know about this.

03:35.960 --> 03:36.840
And Chen Yanyun,

03:36.840 --> 03:38.430
to help the Gu family keep up appearances,

03:38.430 --> 03:39.100
even specially invited

03:39.100 --> 03:41.760
Grand Secretary He's wife
to be the matchmaker.

03:44.430 --> 03:45.490
You're lying to me.

03:50.000 --> 03:51.060
I don't believe it.

03:52.030 --> 03:53.090
You are lying to me.

03:54.870 --> 03:56.000
This is impossible.

03:57.680 --> 03:58.400
Ye Xian!

03:58.420 --> 03:59.140
Get lost!

04:05.920 --> 04:07.240
[Yuheng Gate]

04:07.240 --> 04:10.240
[Ancestral Secret Recipe Meat Soup]

04:08.430 --> 04:08.960
Hya!

04:15.700 --> 04:16.560
[Gu Mansion]

04:18.510 --> 04:20.040
Greetings, Your Lordship.

04:21.160 --> 04:22.019
Your Lordship.

04:23.040 --> 04:23.560
What...

04:23.750 --> 04:24.610
what happened?

04:24.870 --> 04:26.120
G-Go report this quickly.

04:26.120 --> 04:26.630
Yes.

04:29.020 --> 04:32.020
♪ Who, deep beneath the water ♪

04:33.080 --> 04:36.310
♪ Once shared the warmth of a palm ♪

04:37.710 --> 04:41.590
♪ Setting the gears of fate ♪

04:42.460 --> 04:45.320
♪ In motion ♪

04:46.920 --> 04:49.590
♪ One curtain divides two worlds ♪

04:49.750 --> 04:51.390
I am not even afraid of Lord Chen,

04:51.040 --> 04:54.090
♪ Winter and spring
entrust their unspoken feelings ♪

04:51.560 --> 04:53.090
why would I be afraid of you?

04:53.630 --> 04:55.270
Greetings, Uncle.

04:55.510 --> 04:56.760
I pay my respects to you.

04:55.760 --> 05:03.840
♪ Sparks dance in the air,
lighting up the night ♪

04:57.630 --> 04:58.770
You are my elder, Uncle.

04:58.770 --> 05:01.100
Did you bring a gift
for our first meeting?

05:02.170 --> 05:02.680
Wait.

05:03.340 --> 05:04.520
What happened to your hand?

05:04.520 --> 05:07.380
♪ Alone, drunk in a fleeting dream ♪

05:06.560 --> 05:07.600
What happened?

05:08.690 --> 05:12.350
♪ In dreams, I miss you, beyond words ♪

05:08.770 --> 05:09.770
You are awake.

05:10.750 --> 05:11.480
Are you still

05:11.500 --> 05:13.160
feeling unwell anywhere now?

05:13.470 --> 05:17.150
♪ My hand gently brushes past,
and dust settles on the scroll ♪

05:17.940 --> 05:19.440
♪ Amid endless twists and turns ♪

05:18.800 --> 05:19.270
Hey.

05:20.410 --> 05:21.760
♪ Love quietly sinks into silence ♪

05:22.380 --> 05:25.090
♪ Time can never be looked back upon ♪

05:24.920 --> 05:25.680
Thank you.

05:26.770 --> 05:29.490
♪ I only regret missing
even a moment of togetherness ♪

05:30.320 --> 05:32.730
♪ If longing bears no fruit ♪

05:33.800 --> 05:39.659
♪ I'd rather we both sink away ♪

05:58.159 --> 05:59.360
Young Lord Ye is here?

05:59.390 --> 05:59.920
Yes.

06:00.310 --> 06:02.430
They say he looked furious,

06:02.560 --> 06:04.750
and went straight to
the Eldest Miss's courtyard.

06:04.750 --> 06:05.740
At this hour,

06:06.430 --> 06:08.270
what is he doing coming to see Zhao?

06:08.270 --> 06:09.070
Old Madam,

06:09.560 --> 06:11.430
I heard the servants gossiping that

06:11.430 --> 06:12.830
His Lordship is much closer

06:12.830 --> 06:14.000
to the Eldest Miss

06:14.070 --> 06:15.510
than to the other sisters.

06:15.510 --> 06:17.570
It would be fine in the past.

06:17.590 --> 06:18.510
But now,

06:18.750 --> 06:19.870
Eldest Miss is already engaged to

06:19.870 --> 06:20.750
Lord Chen.

06:24.600 --> 06:25.430
You are right.

06:26.160 --> 06:27.620
We can't let him go to Zhao.

06:28.390 --> 06:29.430
Go stop him.

06:30.190 --> 06:30.720
Yes.

06:31.430 --> 06:32.070
Come back.

06:34.830 --> 06:36.630
We can't let outsiders stop him.

06:36.830 --> 06:37.360
Cuilyu,

06:37.870 --> 06:39.330
go tell the Second Master,

06:39.430 --> 06:41.310
and get someone to guard the inner gate.

06:41.310 --> 06:42.800
-Yes, Old Madam.
-Hurry! Hurry!

06:42.800 --> 06:43.400
Remember,

06:43.510 --> 06:45.159
don't let a single stranger in,

06:45.159 --> 06:46.870
and don't let a single word out.

06:46.870 --> 06:47.870
Yes, Old Madam.

06:49.310 --> 06:50.680
I will go there myself.

06:51.510 --> 06:52.680
I speak my mind,

06:52.950 --> 06:54.610
so please don't take offense.

06:55.240 --> 06:56.870
Have you told Xian

06:57.000 --> 06:59.000
about your engagement to Lord Chen?

07:04.950 --> 07:06.810
Then how are you going to tell him?

07:08.160 --> 07:08.680
I...

07:09.830 --> 07:11.560
I've always wanted to tell him.

07:12.390 --> 07:13.360
And

07:14.720 --> 07:16.720
I've arranged to meet him tomorrow.

07:17.800 --> 07:19.060
What are we going to do?

07:19.160 --> 07:20.390
He likes you so much.

07:21.950 --> 07:23.080
You don't know this,

07:23.510 --> 07:25.000
but the military nobility
is in decline now.

07:25.000 --> 07:26.060
People outside say

07:26.160 --> 07:27.120
the Senior Grand Secretary

07:27.120 --> 07:27.600
is preparing to

07:27.600 --> 07:29.920
make an example of our marquis household.

07:29.920 --> 07:30.560
I really don't know

07:30.560 --> 07:32.560
what kind of trouble he might cause.

07:38.040 --> 07:39.240
I'm sorry, Zhao.

07:39.510 --> 07:41.170
I didn't mean to pressure you.

07:41.630 --> 07:43.390
It's just that Ye Xian's temperament…

07:43.390 --> 07:45.590
and it's Chen Yanyun you're engaged to.

07:47.720 --> 07:48.720
I've actually

07:49.800 --> 07:51.680
never known how to bring it up.

07:52.820 --> 07:53.650
What?

07:54.159 --> 07:55.070
Has he never

07:55.070 --> 07:56.800
made his feelings clear to you?

07:59.270 --> 08:00.310
That fool.

08:01.950 --> 08:03.360
Since we've come this far,

08:03.360 --> 08:04.760
I'll just say it outright

08:05.000 --> 08:06.720
and ask something I probably shouldn't.

08:06.720 --> 08:07.390
Do you

08:07.550 --> 08:09.210
have feelings for Xian or not?

08:14.160 --> 08:15.160
I have always

08:15.750 --> 08:17.350
regarded him as a confidant.

08:18.310 --> 08:19.720
What did you just say?

08:27.950 --> 08:28.750
Say it.

08:29.240 --> 08:30.440
What did you just say?

08:31.120 --> 08:32.150
Say it again.

08:33.549 --> 08:34.240
Ye Xian,

08:34.890 --> 08:35.980
don't be like this.

08:37.440 --> 08:39.100
So what they said is true.

08:40.750 --> 08:42.679
You are going to marry Chen Yanyun,

08:43.960 --> 08:44.960
right?

08:47.870 --> 08:48.550
Yes.

08:51.150 --> 08:51.960
I wanted to

08:52.120 --> 08:53.360
tell you earlier.

08:53.360 --> 08:54.030
Xian.

08:56.750 --> 08:57.810
Don't come closer!

09:10.150 --> 09:11.270
Why?

09:14.030 --> 09:15.150
Why?

09:19.150 --> 09:20.510
Because I like him.

09:38.400 --> 09:40.330
I had planned to tell you tomorrow,

09:41.240 --> 09:42.200
but I didn't expect

09:42.200 --> 09:43.390
you to come today.

09:43.790 --> 09:44.510
Ye Xian.

09:46.440 --> 09:47.610
You like him?

09:50.320 --> 09:51.380
I don't believe it.

09:53.320 --> 09:54.380
You're lying to me.

09:57.670 --> 09:59.000
My Lady.

10:00.670 --> 10:01.730
I don't believe it.

10:08.240 --> 10:09.150
Your Lordship.

10:09.960 --> 10:11.880
Why did you suddenly come here?

10:11.920 --> 10:14.120
-Shall we go to the front yard?
-Shut up!

10:15.080 --> 10:16.480
Fifth Daughter-in-Law,

10:16.760 --> 10:18.070
are you going to let your brother

10:18.070 --> 10:19.340
make a scene here?

10:20.620 --> 10:23.140
Ye Xian, put down the knife.

10:23.750 --> 10:24.510
Xian.

10:48.850 --> 10:49.960
Calm down.

10:51.200 --> 10:53.060
Put the knife down and let's talk.

10:59.150 --> 11:00.090
You like him?

11:01.440 --> 11:02.150
Good.

11:03.000 --> 11:03.790
Very good.

11:04.910 --> 11:06.230
You like him.

11:10.750 --> 11:12.210
Your Lordship, I'm sorry!

11:13.120 --> 11:14.150
Xian!

11:14.200 --> 11:15.750
Help Zhao leave through the back door.

11:15.750 --> 11:16.630
Yes.

11:16.670 --> 11:17.870
Go home with me, okay?

11:17.870 --> 11:19.340
My Lady, let's go.

11:19.510 --> 11:20.630
-My Lady.
-Let's go.

11:20.630 --> 11:21.480
Be good.

11:21.550 --> 11:22.440
Be good.

11:24.630 --> 11:25.320
Let's go.

11:25.320 --> 11:27.450
-Let's go, My Lady.
-Let's go, My Lady.

11:28.120 --> 11:29.440
Gu Jinzhao!

11:30.400 --> 11:33.180
♪With every step, I look back ♪

11:32.480 --> 11:33.120
Xian!

11:34.310 --> 11:36.850
♪ My heart grows cold like rust ♪

11:38.140 --> 11:41.260
♪ The stars see you off
on a thousand-mile journey ♪

11:42.120 --> 11:43.440
Get a physician! Get a physician!

11:42.440 --> 11:45.060
♪ Yet one thought still remains ♪

11:43.440 --> 11:44.120
Ye Xian!

11:46.300 --> 11:49.280
♪ You share bright days with another ♪

11:50.030 --> 11:52.910
♪ I walk with my lonely shadow ♪

11:52.670 --> 11:53.240
My Lady.

11:53.880 --> 12:01.840
♪ Filling every broken fold
with memories of us ♪

11:56.770 --> 11:58.570
No one is allowed to follow me.

12:00.080 --> 12:01.320
No one.

12:08.510 --> 12:09.200
Your Lordship.

12:09.200 --> 12:09.910
Xian!

12:09.940 --> 12:11.270
-Your Lordship.
-Xian!

12:17.150 --> 12:19.980
♪With every step, I look back ♪

12:18.740 --> 12:20.680
Zhao.

12:21.220 --> 12:23.190
♪ My heart grows cold like rust ♪

12:21.510 --> 12:22.120
Zhao!

12:22.120 --> 12:23.320
Support her. Quickly.

12:23.320 --> 12:24.750
Zhao!

12:24.760 --> 12:27.640
♪ The stars send you far away ♪

12:25.270 --> 12:26.510
It's alright.

12:26.530 --> 12:27.610
Zhao!

12:28.670 --> 12:31.560
♪ Yet one thought still remains ♪

12:32.550 --> 12:35.620
♪ You share bright days with another ♪

12:36.390 --> 12:39.390
♪ I walk with my lonely shadow ♪

12:40.280 --> 12:46.350
♪ Filling every broken fold
with memories of us ♪

12:48.280 --> 12:50.890
♪With every step, I look back ♪

12:51.770 --> 12:53.970
♪ My heart grows cold like rust ♪

12:55.480 --> 12:58.450
♪ The stars send you far away ♪

12:59.410 --> 13:02.410
♪ Yet one thought still remains ♪

13:03.940 --> 13:06.540
♪ You share bright days with another ♪

13:04.890 --> 13:07.470
[Gu Mansion]

13:07.600 --> 13:10.320
♪ I walk with my lonely shadow ♪

13:11.400 --> 13:17.220
♪ Filling every broken fold
with memories of us ♪

13:16.390 --> 13:17.990
[Gu Mansion]

13:19.220 --> 13:29.010
♪ Filling every broken fold
with memories of us ♪

13:22.390 --> 13:27.630
[Gu Mansion]

13:41.230 --> 13:45.230
[Honor and Illumination]

13:42.440 --> 13:43.270
Jiuheng?

13:47.670 --> 13:49.130
Greetings, Your Majesty.

13:49.840 --> 13:51.300
Chen Yanyun, please rise.

13:51.790 --> 13:53.190
Thank you, Your Majesty.

13:57.390 --> 13:58.000
Mentor.

14:00.720 --> 14:01.510
Chen Yanyun.

14:02.550 --> 14:04.200
Yesterday, Mr. Fu told me

14:04.550 --> 14:06.210
that you are getting married.

14:06.720 --> 14:08.080
And the bride is actually that

14:08.080 --> 14:10.440
Miss Gu who once
beat the Drum of Grievance.

14:10.440 --> 14:12.630
The more I think about it,
the more curious I become.

14:12.630 --> 14:13.630
So I couldn't help

14:13.630 --> 14:15.080
but summon you to the palace

14:15.080 --> 14:16.210
to ask you in person.

14:17.080 --> 14:18.000
Your Majesty.

14:18.670 --> 14:20.390
Lord Chen is currently
serving his punishment.

14:20.390 --> 14:22.450
Summoning him to the palace like this

14:23.200 --> 14:25.120
is against the law.

14:29.200 --> 14:30.080
I realize my mistake.

14:30.080 --> 14:31.340
It won't happen again.

14:34.360 --> 14:35.200
Chen Yanyun.

14:35.840 --> 14:37.510
When do you

14:37.510 --> 14:38.670
intend to marry

14:38.670 --> 14:39.670
that Miss Gu?

14:40.670 --> 14:42.390
Your Majesty, this...

14:42.510 --> 14:43.310
Your Majesty,

14:44.510 --> 14:45.510
how can you pry into

14:45.510 --> 14:47.840
an official's private affairs like this?

14:48.840 --> 14:50.500
Then let me ask it another way.

14:51.550 --> 14:52.360
Chen Yanyun.

14:53.360 --> 14:54.750
I heard

14:54.910 --> 14:56.030
that Miss Gu's maternal family

14:56.030 --> 14:57.430
are your surbordinates.

14:57.600 --> 15:00.000
Have you two been
in contact for a long time?

15:02.150 --> 15:02.950
Your Majesty.

15:03.630 --> 15:05.750
I still have many memorials to review.

15:05.750 --> 15:08.390
You and Jiuheng
can take your time talking.

15:08.790 --> 15:10.190
I shall take my leave now.

15:12.550 --> 15:13.210
Zhang Fang,

15:13.390 --> 15:14.790
see Mr. Fu out for me.

15:15.270 --> 15:16.360
Yes, Your Majesty.

15:18.390 --> 15:19.510
Take care, Mentor.

15:26.670 --> 15:27.470
Your Majesty.

15:28.150 --> 15:29.550
Miss Gu and I...

15:30.960 --> 15:31.720
I am hungry.

15:32.270 --> 15:33.800
Go get me some snacks.

15:34.000 --> 15:35.320
Yes, Your Majesty.

15:52.750 --> 15:53.360
Today,

15:53.440 --> 15:54.270
an imperial censor impeached

15:54.270 --> 15:55.870
the Marquis Changxing
for great disrespect.

15:55.870 --> 15:57.930
Mr. Fu wants to deal with it severely.

15:58.080 --> 16:00.960
But I want to protect
Marquis Changxing's household.

16:00.960 --> 16:01.750
However,

16:01.870 --> 16:03.550
I cannot openly go against Mr. Fu.

16:03.550 --> 16:04.360
So I can only

16:05.360 --> 16:06.550
entrust this to you.

16:21.270 --> 16:21.840
But what I

16:21.840 --> 16:23.390
never expected was that

16:24.080 --> 16:25.720
His Majesty would so directly ask you

16:25.720 --> 16:27.630
to protect
the Marquis Changxing's household.

16:27.630 --> 16:28.750
Isn't this clearly

16:29.200 --> 16:32.000
forcing you to oppose
the Senior Grand Secretary?

16:32.870 --> 16:34.800
Could he be testing you on purpose?

16:39.120 --> 16:40.150
It is a test,

16:40.790 --> 16:41.790
but also an order.

16:42.790 --> 16:43.870
The disaster relief grain case

16:43.870 --> 16:45.150
fell entirely on the Ministry of Revenue,

16:45.150 --> 16:46.610
and I shouldered it alone.

16:47.240 --> 16:48.030
Although this idea

16:48.030 --> 16:49.690
was proposed by Wang Xuanfan,

16:50.630 --> 16:52.080
Mentor remained completely silent

16:52.080 --> 16:53.340
from beginning to end.

16:54.600 --> 16:56.560
This is enough for His Majesty to infer

16:56.560 --> 16:58.510
that it was tacitly approved by Mentor.

16:58.510 --> 16:59.440
At the same time,

17:00.240 --> 17:01.630
His Majesty may also suspect that

17:01.630 --> 17:02.670
Mentor and I

17:02.960 --> 17:04.069
could develop a rift

17:04.069 --> 17:05.069
over this matter.

17:09.310 --> 17:10.510
His Majesty

17:12.510 --> 17:13.780
has grown faster

17:13.829 --> 17:14.880
than we expected.

17:19.030 --> 17:21.200
But even with an imperial edict,

17:21.960 --> 17:23.440
if the Senior Grand Secretary
is determined

17:23.440 --> 17:25.349
bring down
the Marquis Changxing's household,

17:25.349 --> 17:26.720
what can you do?

17:27.790 --> 17:29.510
Let's go see Ye Xian first.

17:46.240 --> 17:46.750
Third Master.

17:46.750 --> 17:47.960
-Third Master!
-Don't move.

17:47.960 --> 17:49.030
Chen Yanyun.

17:52.110 --> 17:52.860
Ye Xian,

17:53.160 --> 17:54.110
are you crazy?

17:54.440 --> 17:55.900
I've always been a madman.

17:55.900 --> 17:56.880
Go to hell!

18:00.030 --> 18:00.550
My Lord!

18:01.570 --> 18:02.460
[Prosperity of Parents]

18:02.000 --> 18:02.600
Stay back!

18:09.350 --> 18:11.770
The imperial censor impeached
your father for grave disrespect.

18:11.770 --> 18:14.030
His Majesty has ordered severe punishment.

18:14.030 --> 18:14.870
Yet you still have the leisure

18:14.870 --> 18:16.470
for matters of romance here.

18:21.620 --> 18:27.790
[Prosperity of Parents]

18:21.960 --> 18:22.510
My Lord.

18:23.680 --> 18:26.020
Miss Gu and I are in love.

18:26.220 --> 18:28.200
How could you possibly separate us?

18:28.200 --> 18:30.060
It's simply wishful thinking.

18:31.070 --> 18:32.030
Chen Yanyun.

18:32.790 --> 18:34.430
I am sworn to
be your irreconcilable enemy.

18:34.430 --> 18:37.550
[Prosperity of Parents]

18:40.960 --> 18:41.760
Third Master.

18:42.200 --> 18:43.790
Spread word of what happened today—

18:43.790 --> 18:44.920
Xian Ye's public assassination attempt,

18:44.920 --> 18:46.200
the carriage stop, and his jealousy

18:46.200 --> 18:46.790
over me.

18:47.960 --> 18:49.960
Make it as widely known as possible.

18:50.750 --> 18:51.270
Okay.

18:54.070 --> 18:55.720
The Marquis Changxing, Ye Guangsheng,

18:55.720 --> 18:57.970
disobeyed the late Emperor
and showed disrespect to His Majesty,

18:57.970 --> 18:59.010
acted obstinately and arrogantly,

18:59.010 --> 19:00.110
and failed in his duties.

19:00.110 --> 19:01.440
The Penal Court is hereby ordered

19:01.440 --> 19:03.510
to immediately arrest the
Marquis Changxing,

19:03.510 --> 19:04.720
and investigate the matter thoroughly

19:04.720 --> 19:06.520
to appease His Majesty's wrath.

19:15.240 --> 19:16.200
I, Ye Xian,

19:17.510 --> 19:18.640
receive the decree.

19:27.400 --> 19:28.030
My Lord.

19:29.640 --> 19:30.240
Let's go.

19:31.080 --> 19:33.210
Come with me to the Marquis' residence

19:34.610 --> 19:36.470
to arrest the Marquis Changxing.

19:39.350 --> 19:39.830
This...

19:44.180 --> 19:52.920
[Marquis Changxing's Mansion]

20:01.160 --> 20:02.790
Come in after an hour.

20:03.510 --> 20:04.680
Yes, my lord!

20:07.650 --> 20:09.720
[Marquis Changxing's Mansion]

20:15.520 --> 20:21.220
[Marquis Changxing's Mansion]

20:23.880 --> 20:24.590
My Lord, Madam.

20:24.590 --> 20:25.790
Young Lord Ye is back.

20:33.030 --> 20:34.640
Father. Mother.

20:36.400 --> 20:38.060
So you do know how to come back.

20:39.960 --> 20:40.680
Xian.

20:44.240 --> 20:45.370
You've lost weight.

20:45.480 --> 20:46.740
And you're darker too.

20:49.030 --> 20:50.550
You haven't eaten yet, right?

20:50.550 --> 20:52.610
Why don't you sit down and eat with us?

20:59.350 --> 21:00.590
If you don't want to eat, that's fine too.

21:00.590 --> 21:01.450
Let's eat then.

21:03.550 --> 21:04.200
Okay.

21:04.680 --> 21:05.240
Come.

21:05.440 --> 21:06.000
Hurry.

21:09.270 --> 21:10.200
Tell the kitchen

21:10.200 --> 21:12.160
to add a plate
of stir-fried pork with yellow chives,

21:12.160 --> 21:13.340
radish meatball soup,

21:13.340 --> 21:14.310
and those

21:14.310 --> 21:15.510
meat-filled flatbreads.

21:15.510 --> 21:16.350
Xian

21:16.350 --> 21:17.310
loves those the most.

21:17.310 --> 21:18.270
Yes, Madam.

21:21.350 --> 21:22.160
Xian,

21:22.960 --> 21:24.550
is your work at the Penal Court

21:24.550 --> 21:25.870
very busy?

21:26.440 --> 21:27.070
It's fine.

21:27.830 --> 21:29.160
What do you mean "fine"?

21:30.110 --> 21:32.310
I heard you went to Shanxi earlier

21:32.440 --> 21:33.880
and almost lost your life.

21:33.880 --> 21:34.830
Is that true?

21:36.160 --> 21:37.760
How could it be so dangerous?

21:38.160 --> 21:40.220
Isn't Father also in constant danger

21:40.590 --> 21:42.720
of losing his life on the battlefield?

21:43.510 --> 21:44.770
What I do is different.

21:44.900 --> 21:46.580
I was fighting enemies.

21:47.240 --> 21:48.300
But what about you?

21:48.830 --> 21:50.790
You've become a tool
in their factional struggles,

21:50.790 --> 21:51.440
a blade

21:53.070 --> 21:54.440
in His Majesty's hand.

21:56.310 --> 21:58.040
It's rare for him to come back.

21:58.110 --> 21:59.240
Why are you saying all this?

21:59.240 --> 22:00.070
Am I wrong?

22:00.750 --> 22:02.810
Go out and ask around what kind of work

22:02.960 --> 22:04.090
the Penal Court

22:04.350 --> 22:05.720
does every day.

22:06.310 --> 22:07.590
In this vast court,

22:08.110 --> 22:10.040
who is not the His Majesty's blade?

22:10.310 --> 22:12.200
And who would dare not be his blade?

22:12.200 --> 22:12.640
You...

22:13.960 --> 22:15.490
You are an educated person.

22:15.830 --> 22:17.510
Have you learned all that scholarship

22:17.510 --> 22:19.400
just to feed it to the dogs?

22:20.160 --> 22:21.640
I don't care what you think.

22:21.640 --> 22:24.030
Tomorrow I will submit a memorial
to the Empress Dowager

22:24.030 --> 22:26.360
and have you removed from the Penal Court.

22:26.480 --> 22:26.920
I've already

22:26.920 --> 22:28.380
talked to your Uncle Song.

22:28.830 --> 22:30.590
You will be transferred
to the Ministry of War.

22:30.590 --> 22:31.200
I won't go.

22:31.920 --> 22:32.440
Uncle Song

22:32.440 --> 22:33.970
won't listen to you either.

22:34.920 --> 22:36.580
You brat, how dare you defy me!

22:45.680 --> 22:47.940
Marquis Changxing, receive the decree.

23:01.010 --> 23:07.150
[Great Merit and High Esteem]

23:12.590 --> 23:13.270
My Lord.

23:17.830 --> 23:18.960
I do not accept this.

23:20.070 --> 23:21.900
Since His Majesty ascended the throne,

23:21.900 --> 23:24.900
I have not stepped
out of the residence due to illness.

23:26.160 --> 23:27.760
What crime have I committed?

23:28.400 --> 23:30.000
If you have any objections,

23:30.920 --> 23:33.240
you can state them in the imperial prison.

23:33.240 --> 23:35.160
The imperial command cannot be delayed.

23:35.160 --> 23:36.590
I will wait outside.

23:37.550 --> 23:38.590
Please come out

23:39.640 --> 23:40.850
within 15 minutes.

23:41.070 --> 23:41.830
Xian!

23:42.680 --> 23:43.310
Mother,

23:43.680 --> 23:44.440
I am also...

23:44.510 --> 23:46.680
You unfilial son!

23:51.510 --> 23:55.110
Are you trying to kill your own father?

24:00.150 --> 24:09.590
[Great Merit and High Esteem]

24:08.830 --> 24:09.510
My Lord.

24:31.070 --> 24:31.880
If I were you,

24:32.800 --> 24:34.760
I would request to be imprisoned as well.

24:34.760 --> 24:35.540
That way,

24:36.590 --> 24:37.960
at least in the Penal Court,

24:37.960 --> 24:40.110
no one would be able
to move against the Marquis.

24:40.110 --> 24:42.640
And he would secure
a slim chance of survival.

24:44.750 --> 24:46.010
Why should I trust you?

24:49.810 --> 24:50.820
My Lord.

24:51.550 --> 24:52.610
Vice Commander Hu.

24:52.720 --> 24:59.430
[A Legacy of Virtue and Grace]

24:53.160 --> 24:53.680
My Lord.

24:55.720 --> 24:58.710
Since the imperial censor impeached
Marquis Changxing for disrespect,

24:58.710 --> 25:00.720
as the heir of the Marquis's household,

25:00.720 --> 25:03.120
I should also be imprisoned
to await trial.

25:03.240 --> 25:05.570
Vice Commander Hu, please bind me as well.

25:06.240 --> 25:07.240
You unfilial son!

25:07.330 --> 25:08.390
What are you doing?

25:08.450 --> 25:09.020
My Lord.

25:09.160 --> 25:10.620
Is this really necessary?

25:11.120 --> 25:11.640
What?

25:12.920 --> 25:13.880
Does no one

25:13.880 --> 25:15.210
obey my orders anymore?

25:18.110 --> 25:18.640
Okay.

25:23.830 --> 25:25.200
Xian, you can't go.

25:25.200 --> 25:26.110
Don't go!

25:26.110 --> 25:26.920
Xian!

25:31.110 --> 25:32.070
No, Xian.

25:32.640 --> 25:33.850
No!

25:33.960 --> 25:36.270
Xian!

25:37.270 --> 25:38.310
No!

25:38.310 --> 25:39.000
Madam.

25:39.830 --> 25:42.200
Xian, you can't go!

25:42.830 --> 25:43.590
Your Lordship!

25:43.590 --> 25:44.550
Xian!

25:45.510 --> 25:46.310
Chen Yanyun.

25:46.880 --> 25:48.810
I have acted according to the plan.

25:49.200 --> 25:50.600
If you dare to deceive me,

25:51.000 --> 25:52.680
I will tear you to pieces.

25:56.920 --> 25:57.830
My Lord.

26:05.310 --> 26:06.110
Third Master.

26:06.960 --> 26:07.920
Last night, Young Lord Ye

26:07.920 --> 26:09.960
personally went to the Marquis' residence
to arrest Marquis Changxing

26:09.960 --> 26:11.480
and then requested
to be imprisoned as well.

26:11.480 --> 26:13.610
Now they've been taken away together.

26:15.510 --> 26:16.680
I was worried

26:16.720 --> 26:18.030
that because of Miss Gu,

26:18.030 --> 26:19.760
he wouldn't trust you anymore.

26:19.790 --> 26:20.850
I didn't expect him

26:21.070 --> 26:22.400
to actually do it.

26:25.200 --> 26:26.530
He's quite a character.

26:26.590 --> 26:28.030
So what should

26:29.310 --> 26:30.880
we do next?

26:34.830 --> 26:35.760
Build momentum.

26:40.440 --> 26:41.440
Build momentum?

26:42.160 --> 26:44.270
Marquis Changxing enjoys immense prestige.

26:44.270 --> 26:44.960
Mentor

26:45.240 --> 26:46.960
not only wants Marquis Changxing's life,

26:46.960 --> 26:47.830
but also wants to destroy

26:47.830 --> 26:49.000
his reputation.

26:50.440 --> 26:53.200
But His Majesty wants to protect
Marquis Changxing's household.

26:53.200 --> 26:54.030
He will find no support

26:54.030 --> 26:55.200
within the court.

26:55.440 --> 26:57.840
We can only make efforts
outside the court.

26:58.400 --> 26:59.440
Ye Xian arresting his own father

26:59.440 --> 27:00.590
defies social conventions.

27:00.590 --> 27:02.200
And his voluntary imprisonment

27:02.200 --> 27:03.910
only further proves his innocence.

27:03.910 --> 27:05.170
These two points alone

27:05.400 --> 27:07.440
will cause a sensation in the capital.

27:07.440 --> 27:09.040
If we build enough momentum,

27:10.550 --> 27:13.010
His Majesty will
have grounds to intervene.

27:13.160 --> 27:14.400
Then we can find a way

27:15.270 --> 27:17.000
to get them a lighter sentence.

27:18.270 --> 27:19.270
Brilliant.

27:20.200 --> 27:22.510
Among all crimes since ancient times,

27:23.000 --> 27:25.790
the crime of great disrespect
is the most elusive.

27:25.790 --> 27:26.990
It is based on hearsay

27:27.070 --> 27:28.400
and lacks any evidence.

27:29.000 --> 27:30.590
It is truly the most convenient charge

27:30.590 --> 27:32.110
for framing someone.

27:33.110 --> 27:35.370
Precisely because there is no evidence,

27:35.680 --> 27:37.920
it can be dealt with

27:39.000 --> 27:39.930
either severely

27:41.680 --> 27:43.680
or lightly.

27:52.830 --> 27:54.510
But all I can do

27:56.070 --> 27:58.270
is preserve the Marquis's reputation.

27:59.640 --> 28:00.900
As for saving his life—

28:02.550 --> 28:03.750
it will be difficult.

28:17.480 --> 28:18.160
Ruixiang,

28:18.440 --> 28:19.500
get me another pot.

28:20.000 --> 28:21.440
Stop drinking.

28:21.830 --> 28:23.430
You've already had two pots.

28:23.720 --> 28:24.440
You always

28:24.590 --> 28:25.720
look down on people

28:25.720 --> 28:27.110
who drown their sorrows in drink,

28:27.110 --> 28:28.570
and say they are pathetic.

28:28.880 --> 28:29.660
If they truly get angry,

28:29.660 --> 28:30.830
just kill someone.

28:31.680 --> 28:33.590
So why are you acting like this now?

28:33.590 --> 28:34.720
Kill someone?

28:35.110 --> 28:35.750
Kill who?

28:36.550 --> 28:37.350
Your brother?

28:37.510 --> 28:38.510
I can't beat him.

28:38.830 --> 28:40.590
And I can't bear to hurt Ye Xian.

28:42.720 --> 28:43.590
Maybe,

28:44.440 --> 28:45.000
I should just kill

28:45.000 --> 28:46.310
Gu Jinzhao.

28:46.510 --> 28:47.640
Stop talking nonsense.

28:47.640 --> 28:49.640
You two don't have that much bad blood.

28:49.640 --> 28:50.510
Don't tell me

28:50.790 --> 28:51.920
you like my brother?

28:51.960 --> 28:53.760
Who told you I like your brother?

28:54.310 --> 28:55.640
He's full of schemes.

28:56.960 --> 28:58.320
I like Ye Xian.

28:58.720 --> 28:59.750
There you go.

28:59.920 --> 29:01.680
Jinzhao doesn't like Ye Xian.

29:01.750 --> 29:03.030
No one's trying to take him from you.

29:03.030 --> 29:04.350
That's exactly the problem.

29:04.350 --> 29:06.080
I'd rather she fight me for him,

29:06.720 --> 29:07.510
so we could

29:07.510 --> 29:08.960
settle it head-on.

29:09.200 --> 29:10.200
But look at things now.

29:10.200 --> 29:11.110
She doesn't care at all,

29:11.110 --> 29:12.680
while Ye Xian has lost his mind—

29:12.680 --> 29:13.960
storming into the Gu residence
and even trying

29:13.960 --> 29:16.590
to assassinate your brother
in broad daylight.

29:16.590 --> 29:18.250
Though, he does have my style.

29:19.790 --> 29:20.720
Yeah.

29:21.240 --> 29:22.440
I didn't expect Ye Xian

29:22.440 --> 29:24.310
to like Jinzhao so much.

29:24.960 --> 29:26.000
And I really didn't expect

29:26.000 --> 29:26.480
Yanyun

29:26.480 --> 29:27.880
to like her that much either.

29:27.880 --> 29:28.590
Let me tell you.

29:28.590 --> 29:29.400
Yanyun even stood up

29:29.400 --> 29:30.530
to my mother for her,

29:31.070 --> 29:31.640
and specially

29:31.640 --> 29:33.510
asked Madam He to act as matchmaker.

29:33.510 --> 29:34.640
I've never seen him

29:34.640 --> 29:36.510
like someone so much.

29:37.070 --> 29:38.960
But it makes sense.

29:39.160 --> 29:39.880
Jinzhao

29:39.880 --> 29:41.280
is really quite lovable.

29:41.720 --> 29:43.510
Who said she's lovable?

29:43.830 --> 29:45.200
She's not honest at all.

29:45.480 --> 29:47.160
She clearly knows I like Ye Xian.

29:47.160 --> 29:48.000
So why didn't she tell me

29:48.000 --> 29:49.200
that he likes her?

29:49.750 --> 29:51.000
She just wanted to make a fool of me.

29:51.000 --> 29:52.350
Don't be mad.

29:52.880 --> 29:54.270
I don't think Jinzhao

29:54.270 --> 29:55.800
kept it from you on purpose.

29:55.880 --> 29:56.790
Think about it.

29:56.920 --> 29:58.350
She is an unmarried girl,

29:58.440 --> 29:59.830
and she is not that close to you.

29:59.830 --> 30:01.000
If you suddenly told her

30:01.000 --> 30:02.000
you liked Ye Xian,

30:02.160 --> 30:03.310
what was she supposed to say?

30:03.310 --> 30:03.960
Was she supposed to say,

30:03.960 --> 30:05.350
"Don't like him. He likes me,

30:05.350 --> 30:06.550
but I don't like him"?

30:06.880 --> 30:07.400
You...

30:08.200 --> 30:09.800
Are you trying to confuse me?

30:11.880 --> 30:13.310
Anyway, whether it was intentional

30:13.310 --> 30:14.240
or not,

30:14.240 --> 30:15.700
she is my rival in love now.

30:15.750 --> 30:17.280
I won't be friends with her.

30:18.680 --> 30:20.340
You are not allowed to either.

30:20.830 --> 30:22.630
I won't be on good terms with her.

30:23.440 --> 30:25.640
Anyway, she is my third sister-in-law.

30:25.680 --> 30:26.750
You bad girl.

30:26.750 --> 30:27.590
Come here.

30:27.830 --> 30:28.790
My Lady. My Lady.

30:28.790 --> 30:29.920
Something's wrong.

30:32.720 --> 30:33.510
Young Lord Ye

30:33.510 --> 30:35.200
has been imprisoned in the Penal Court.

30:35.200 --> 30:35.790
What?

30:36.270 --> 30:37.130
What happened?

30:37.270 --> 30:38.720
They said
an imperial censor has impeached

30:38.720 --> 30:40.160
the Marquis Changxing
for great disrespect,

30:40.160 --> 30:41.510
and His Majesty ordered
to punish him severely.

30:41.510 --> 30:42.070
Young Lord Ye

30:42.070 --> 30:43.550
personally went to arrest the Marquis,

30:43.550 --> 30:46.010
and then requested
to be imprisoned as well.

30:48.350 --> 30:49.030
Can you go

30:49.030 --> 30:50.200
and beg Chen Yanyun for me?

30:50.200 --> 30:51.460
Ask him to save Ye Xian.

30:52.160 --> 30:52.680
I...

30:53.350 --> 30:54.680
Yanyun never allows the family

30:54.680 --> 30:56.410
to interfere in court affairs.

30:56.720 --> 30:59.120
I'm afraid my words
won't carry any weight.

31:00.830 --> 31:01.310
Fine.

31:02.160 --> 31:04.020
Your words hold no weight, right?

31:04.200 --> 31:04.750
Then I'll go find

31:04.750 --> 31:06.080
someone whose words do.

31:12.480 --> 31:13.070
What?

31:13.680 --> 31:16.110
Ye Xian has been imprisoned
in the Penal Court?

31:16.110 --> 31:17.710
It happened just last night.

31:18.000 --> 31:19.310
Rumor has it that

31:19.510 --> 31:20.510
the Marquis Changxing

31:20.510 --> 31:21.590
has committed a grave offense.

31:21.590 --> 31:22.790
And the court will deal with it severely.

31:22.790 --> 31:23.750
They even locked up Young Lord Ye

31:23.750 --> 31:24.920
and the Marquis.

31:28.920 --> 31:29.550
Zhao.

31:29.790 --> 31:30.550
Fifth Aunt.

31:31.310 --> 31:32.160
Ye Xian and my father

31:32.160 --> 31:34.030
have been imprisoned in the Penal Court.

31:34.030 --> 31:34.590
Right now,

31:34.590 --> 31:35.750
I have no other way out.

31:35.750 --> 31:36.950
I have to come beg you.

31:37.640 --> 31:38.920
Can you please help me

31:38.920 --> 31:40.250
and plead with Lord Chen

31:40.680 --> 31:42.140
to save Xian and my father?

31:43.440 --> 31:44.240
Please don't do this.

31:44.240 --> 31:44.920
Get up.

31:45.510 --> 31:46.640
I heard about it too,

31:46.640 --> 31:48.000
so I was about to go find Third Master

31:48.000 --> 31:48.980
to think of a way.

31:49.550 --> 31:50.950
You are not allowed to go.

31:56.550 --> 31:57.240
Lady Ye.

31:58.790 --> 32:00.110
Didn't I warn you

32:00.590 --> 32:02.140
not to come to Zhao?

32:02.510 --> 32:03.770
Why didn't you listen?

32:04.510 --> 32:05.440
The other day, Ye Xian

32:05.440 --> 32:06.700
made such a huge scene.

32:07.510 --> 32:09.400
How do you still
have the nerve to ask Zhao

32:09.400 --> 32:10.750
to plead with Lord Chen?

32:11.830 --> 32:13.370
Don't you know

32:13.440 --> 32:15.030
what crime Marquis Changxing
has committed?

32:15.030 --> 32:16.200
It's a charge of great disrespect—

32:16.200 --> 32:18.130
enough to wipe out the entire clan!

32:18.310 --> 32:19.160
Do you think

32:19.510 --> 32:20.720
our Gu family hasn't suffered

32:20.720 --> 32:21.650
enough already?

32:22.350 --> 32:23.550
You're dragging our Gu family into this

32:23.550 --> 32:25.270
just for your own household.

32:25.640 --> 32:26.510
Don't forget

32:27.350 --> 32:29.550
you are a daughter-in-law of our family.

32:29.550 --> 32:31.070
I am a daughter-in-law of the Gu family,

32:31.070 --> 32:33.400
but I am even more
a daughter of the Ye family.

32:33.400 --> 32:34.680
If you're afraid of
being implicated by me,

32:34.680 --> 32:36.510
then have Dexiu write a letter of divorce.

32:36.510 --> 32:37.510
Do you think we wouldn't dare

32:37.510 --> 32:38.480
to write it?

32:39.350 --> 32:40.280
I'm warning you.

32:41.400 --> 32:42.750
The current Marquis household

32:42.750 --> 32:43.880
cannot protect you.

32:45.200 --> 32:45.960
Well.

32:46.830 --> 32:48.880
When the Marquis household was in power,

32:48.880 --> 32:50.030
you came crawling to me

32:50.030 --> 32:51.160
time and time again.

32:51.920 --> 32:53.380
Now that we're in trouble,

32:53.790 --> 32:55.000
you immediately turn your backs on us

32:55.000 --> 32:56.230
and avoid us like the plague.

32:56.230 --> 32:57.960
What a snobbish attitude.

32:59.310 --> 33:01.310
If you want to write
a letter of divorce, go ahead.

33:01.310 --> 33:03.970
I'm the one who finds
your Gu family disgusting.

33:04.830 --> 33:05.480
Zhao.

33:06.270 --> 33:07.730
I'm not talking about you.

33:07.920 --> 33:08.550
I know I may

33:08.570 --> 33:09.770
be asking too much,

33:10.000 --> 33:11.550
but I have no other way right now—

33:11.550 --> 33:13.080
I can only beg for your help.

33:13.240 --> 33:14.830
Fifth Aunt, don't panic.

33:15.000 --> 33:16.600
Since I promised to help you,

33:16.680 --> 33:17.680
I definitely will.

33:17.680 --> 33:18.510
Zhao.

33:20.240 --> 33:21.040
Grandmother.

33:21.310 --> 33:22.720
Right now, even if you ask Fifth Uncle

33:22.720 --> 33:24.110
to write a divorce letter for Fifth Aunt,

33:24.110 --> 33:25.510
it's too late to cut ties.

33:26.030 --> 33:26.960
If the Marquis household falls,

33:26.960 --> 33:27.960
do you think there will be

33:27.960 --> 33:29.560
any benefit to our Gu family?

33:29.680 --> 33:30.460
We are family.

33:30.460 --> 33:31.550
If we don't help now,

33:31.550 --> 33:32.510
when will we?

33:32.920 --> 33:33.720
Zhao.

33:33.740 --> 33:35.350
I heard rumors that

33:35.550 --> 33:38.750
Ye Xian tried to assassinate
Lord Chen in broad daylight.

33:39.070 --> 33:40.000
I heard that too.

33:40.680 --> 33:41.310
That is why

33:41.640 --> 33:42.770
I must go take a look.

33:50.270 --> 33:51.070
Qinglan.

33:55.590 --> 33:56.030
You are also here

33:56.030 --> 33:57.550
for Ye Xian?

33:58.400 --> 33:59.270
You're smart.

34:00.200 --> 34:01.070
If you still consider Ye Xian

34:01.070 --> 34:02.000
a friend,

34:02.240 --> 34:03.550
then go and ask Chen Yanyun

34:03.550 --> 34:04.480
to help save him.

34:25.440 --> 34:26.190
Have a seat.

34:30.760 --> 34:31.510
How is it?

34:31.800 --> 34:33.590
Is there still any hope for
the Marquis Changxing's household?

34:33.590 --> 34:35.050
There wasn't any at first.

34:35.320 --> 34:35.800
But

34:36.400 --> 34:38.960
Ye Xian went to prison
along with the Marquis Changxing—

34:38.960 --> 34:39.960
so that's created

34:40.480 --> 34:42.679
a slim chance of turning things around.

34:43.920 --> 34:44.710
Right.

34:45.400 --> 34:47.000
On the day of the palace coup,

34:47.360 --> 34:50.150
Marquis Changxing was accused of treason.

34:50.400 --> 34:52.440
Ye Xian risked his life
to protect His Majesty,

34:52.440 --> 34:55.150
which made the charge of treason
fall apart on its own.

34:55.150 --> 34:57.150
Now that Ye Xian has been imprisoned

34:57.190 --> 34:58.720
together with the Marquis,

34:59.760 --> 35:02.140
it may achieve a similar effect.

35:03.360 --> 35:04.420
It's not just that.

35:04.510 --> 35:05.670
Ye Xian going into prison

35:05.670 --> 35:07.600
can also protect the Marquis a bit.

35:07.960 --> 35:08.890
What do you mean?

35:09.150 --> 35:10.410
Is someone planning to

35:10.670 --> 35:12.070
move against the Marquis in prison?

35:12.070 --> 35:13.440
It's just a precaution.

35:16.590 --> 35:18.880
Do you have any way to save Ye Xian?

35:19.280 --> 35:20.070
I do,

35:20.710 --> 35:21.440
but

35:22.480 --> 35:25.010
it will require you
to suffer some grievance.

35:30.070 --> 35:31.280
For the Ye family case,

35:31.280 --> 35:32.940
you should be the chief judge.

35:34.400 --> 35:35.300
But I

35:35.400 --> 35:37.060
haven't been reinstated yet.

35:38.000 --> 35:39.880
After you finish

35:41.550 --> 35:43.150
judging Marquis Changxing,

35:43.150 --> 35:45.950
you can return to
the Hall of Literary Profundity.

35:46.630 --> 35:47.690
Thank you, mentor.

35:48.550 --> 35:49.320
However,

35:49.800 --> 35:50.920
I think

35:51.550 --> 35:53.480
it's still not quite appropriate.

35:58.000 --> 35:59.130
I've heard about it.

36:00.550 --> 36:01.320
Ye Xian

36:02.150 --> 36:04.070
actually attempted to assassinate

36:04.070 --> 36:06.150
a Grand Secretary in broad daylight.

36:06.200 --> 36:07.880
Truly appalling.

36:08.590 --> 36:10.590
It is just that you are magnanimous.

36:11.360 --> 36:12.950
Otherwise, this alone

36:13.670 --> 36:15.130
would be enough to condemn

36:15.480 --> 36:17.340
Marquis Changxing's household.

36:20.550 --> 36:22.280
My apologies for this, mentor.

36:22.710 --> 36:23.920
I originally thought

36:24.150 --> 36:25.750
it was just a private matter,

36:26.030 --> 36:28.160
and blowing it up wouldn't do any good.

36:28.230 --> 36:29.150
But now

36:29.670 --> 36:31.800
it's known to
the whole court and the public.

36:31.800 --> 36:34.030
Everyone says
the feud between Ye Xian and me

36:34.030 --> 36:35.160
is irreconcilable.

36:35.360 --> 36:36.670
If I were now

36:37.150 --> 36:38.710
to try the Ye family case,

36:39.960 --> 36:41.560
I fear people would accuse me

36:41.710 --> 36:44.360
of using my public office
to settle personal scores.

36:44.360 --> 36:45.630
Let them talk.

36:46.260 --> 36:47.510
Whoever protests the loudest

36:47.510 --> 36:49.770
is part of Marquis Changxing's faction.

36:50.480 --> 36:51.880
I was just worrying about

36:52.150 --> 36:54.750
not having enough people
to make an example of.

36:54.920 --> 36:55.760
Go ahead and handle it.

36:55.760 --> 36:57.620
Don't worry about anything else.

36:59.230 --> 36:59.670
Yes.

37:00.590 --> 37:01.140
Mentor.

37:01.550 --> 37:02.280
In that case,

37:02.280 --> 37:03.610
there's no time to lose.

37:03.630 --> 37:04.280
I

37:04.760 --> 37:05.620
will go back now

37:06.030 --> 37:07.430
to prepare for the trial.

37:08.150 --> 37:08.760
Okay.

37:33.760 --> 37:34.360
Mentor.

37:37.590 --> 37:40.000
You always manage to come up with a plan

37:40.150 --> 37:42.250
whenever it comes to Jiuheng.

37:42.440 --> 37:43.150
Isn't it all

37:43.150 --> 37:44.500
for you, Mentor?

37:45.030 --> 37:46.000
When I was in prison,

37:46.000 --> 37:47.130
I wondered every day

37:47.320 --> 37:49.660
who sent Ye Xian to go to Shanxi,

37:49.800 --> 37:51.840
and how he managed
to get there so quickly.

37:51.840 --> 37:53.300
Later I also recalled that

37:53.440 --> 37:54.280
not long ago,

37:54.760 --> 37:56.230
when Prince Ruichang rebelled,

37:56.230 --> 37:58.150
Ye Xian entered the palace

37:58.150 --> 37:59.880
at precisely the right moment.

38:00.280 --> 38:02.030
Putting these two things together,

38:02.030 --> 38:02.800
I dare say

38:03.510 --> 38:04.880
someone among our people

38:04.880 --> 38:06.280
has long been secretly

38:06.510 --> 38:08.030
colluding with Ye Xian.

38:12.150 --> 38:13.190
You think this person is...

38:13.190 --> 38:14.720
This person can never be me,

38:15.150 --> 38:16.150
let alone you.

38:16.760 --> 38:17.690
As for He Wenxin,

38:17.840 --> 38:20.480
he just wants to be a Grand Secretary
who avoids politics.

38:20.480 --> 38:21.480
And has never had any ties

38:21.480 --> 38:23.510
with the Marquis Changxing's household.

38:23.510 --> 38:25.170
Then who else is left among us?

38:27.190 --> 38:28.930
There is only Jiuheng.

38:29.880 --> 38:31.800
Unless Jiuheng takes
heavy-handed measures this time

38:31.800 --> 38:33.760
to severely punish Marquis Changxing,

38:33.760 --> 38:34.560
otherwise...

38:41.360 --> 38:41.880
Third Master.

38:41.880 --> 38:45.280
[Thrice Reflections Against Greed;
Ninefold Virtues in the Sound of the Qin]

38:42.230 --> 38:43.680
News came from Mr. Jiang.

38:43.880 --> 38:44.810
As you expected,

38:45.440 --> 38:46.630
Wang Xuanfan went to

38:46.630 --> 38:48.430
the Senior Grand Secretary's residence
early this morning

38:48.430 --> 38:49.890
and hasn't come out since.

38:49.920 --> 38:51.480
He's been trying to sow doubt

38:51.480 --> 38:52.940
about me in Mentor's mind.

38:58.590 --> 39:00.150
Go tell the Penal Court.

39:01.030 --> 39:02.430
Early tomorrow morning,

39:03.070 --> 39:05.400
I'll interrogate Ye Xian and the Marquis.

39:08.960 --> 39:11.220
I don't need you
to stay in prison with me!

39:13.960 --> 39:14.440
Father.

39:14.800 --> 39:16.320
Your wounds haven't healed yet.

39:16.320 --> 39:17.120
Stop talking.

39:21.870 --> 39:23.500
It seems this time Fu Hailian

39:24.230 --> 39:25.830
is determined to see me dead.

39:26.030 --> 39:27.550
And you still came in here with me.

39:27.550 --> 39:29.030
Do you think that makes you filial?

39:29.030 --> 39:29.940
How foolish!

39:30.590 --> 39:32.190
Find a way to get out of here quickly

39:32.190 --> 39:33.140
and protect your mother

39:33.140 --> 39:34.220
and your sister.

39:35.320 --> 39:37.520
If the marquisate is gone, then so be it.

39:37.960 --> 39:41.030
You never wanted
to inherit the title anyway.

39:43.280 --> 39:44.080
Stop talking.

39:45.510 --> 39:46.000
Please.

39:51.960 --> 39:52.890
Why are you here?

40:02.280 --> 40:03.030
Greetings,

40:03.090 --> 40:03.930
My Lord.

40:07.590 --> 40:08.880
Did Fu Hailian

40:08.960 --> 40:10.490
send you to interrogate me?

40:11.110 --> 40:13.640
Why didn't he come
to interrogate me himself?

40:13.880 --> 40:15.610
He hides behind others all day

40:15.880 --> 40:17.150
and plays tricks.

40:17.880 --> 40:19.740
And he still has the nerve to claim

40:20.070 --> 40:22.070
it's for the country and the people.

40:24.870 --> 40:27.600
The Senior Grand Secretary
is occupied with many affairs

40:27.600 --> 40:29.400
and may not be able to come in person.

40:29.400 --> 40:29.960
But

40:30.360 --> 40:31.360
I will certainly

40:31.430 --> 40:32.360
relay your words

40:32.710 --> 40:33.850
to him.

40:38.230 --> 40:39.510
My son

40:40.320 --> 40:41.850
is naturally a bit foolish.

40:42.840 --> 40:44.700
He was afraid I'd suffer here,

40:44.800 --> 40:46.930
so he came to keep me company in prison.

40:47.190 --> 40:49.320
This matter has nothing to do with him.

40:50.190 --> 40:51.380
Let him go first.

40:51.590 --> 40:52.050
Father.

40:52.150 --> 40:52.760
Shut up!

40:55.400 --> 40:57.170
Your deep love for your son

40:57.280 --> 40:58.810
really touches me, My Lord.

41:00.030 --> 41:00.550
But

41:01.360 --> 41:03.090
I'm afraid you still don't know

41:03.110 --> 41:04.150
that Young Lord Ye

41:04.170 --> 41:05.440
almost stabbed me

41:05.440 --> 41:06.830
to death on the street.

41:07.110 --> 41:09.170
It's pure luck that I can still be here

41:09.510 --> 41:10.840
questioning you today.

41:11.840 --> 41:13.500
As for the food in this prison,

41:13.710 --> 41:15.310
I doubt you and Young Lord Ye

41:15.590 --> 41:16.810
would be able to eat it

41:16.880 --> 41:17.810
or get used to it.

41:18.710 --> 41:20.060
Then don't eat it.

41:20.320 --> 41:21.250
Take it all away.

41:21.320 --> 41:22.810
Chen Yanyun, how dare you!

41:24.030 --> 41:25.090
What are you doing?

41:26.230 --> 41:27.380
I

41:27.510 --> 41:29.190
am the chief interrogator of this case.

41:29.190 --> 41:30.230
Young Lord Ye,

41:30.320 --> 41:32.980
you'd better think carefully
before you speak.

41:36.190 --> 41:36.790
My Lord,

41:36.840 --> 41:38.280
the prisoners are still awaiting trial.

41:38.280 --> 41:40.540
We can't afford to have them die, My Lord.

41:47.440 --> 41:48.550
Bring the Marquis out.

41:48.550 --> 41:48.920
Yes.

41:49.670 --> 41:50.130
Guards.

42:09.630 --> 42:11.510
Ask whatever you want.

42:11.510 --> 42:13.920
I have a clear conscience.

42:15.590 --> 42:16.360
I have

42:16.800 --> 42:17.880
nothing to ask.

42:20.560 --> 42:23.670
[Confession of Marquis Changxing]

42:25.840 --> 42:27.550
These are my charges?

42:29.440 --> 42:30.550
It's a confession.

42:31.800 --> 42:34.050
You have admitted to your crimes

42:34.100 --> 42:35.100
without dispute.

42:35.440 --> 42:36.300
All that is left

42:36.760 --> 42:37.890
is for you to sign it.

43:01.280 --> 43:02.080
Third Master.

43:10.350 --> 43:12.610
When a nation is on the brink of collapse,

43:12.910 --> 43:15.840
treacherous officials like you
are bound to emerge.

43:16.710 --> 43:18.510
Even if it costs me my life,

43:19.330 --> 43:21.660
I will rid the country
of evil men like you.

43:23.880 --> 43:25.820
What a Marquis Changxing.

43:25.920 --> 43:27.900
Truly majestic.

43:28.510 --> 43:29.510
But don't forget,

43:30.380 --> 43:32.230
your son is still in my hands.

43:44.980 --> 43:48.580
[A Splendid Match]
